  },
  {
   "text": "ACT NO. 16 OF 1908",
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 253.85,
   "x1": 353.95,
   "top": 93.57199999999989,
   "size": 12.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": [
    "1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "[18th December, 1908.]",
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 434.83,
   "x1": 540.05488,
   "top": 113.16463999999996,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "An Act to consolidate the enactments relating to the Registration of Documents.",
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 72.024,
   "x1": 456.46400000000006,
   "top": 131.97199999999998,
   "size": 12.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "WHEREAS it is expedient to consolidate the enactments relating to the registration of documents; it is",
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 90.024,
   "x1": 540.06784,
   "top": 151.56463999999994,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "hereby enacted as follows:—",
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 72.024,
   "x1": 200.09,
   "top": 164.28463999999997,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "PART I",
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 288.65,
   "x1": 323.28247999999996,
   "top": 182.88464,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "PRELIMINARY",
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 274.61,
   "x1": 337.142,
   "top": 199.56463999999994,
   "size": 9.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "1. Short title, extent and commencement.—(1) This Act may be called the *** Registration Act,",
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 90.024,
   "x1": 540.04288,
   "top": 216.24464,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "1. Short title, extent and commencement",
   "markers": [
    "2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "1908.",
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 72.024,
   "x1": 96.864,
   "top": 228.84464000000003,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "[(2) It extends to the whole of India ***:",
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 93.504,
   "x1": 276.11912,
   "top": 245.55463999999995,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": [
    "3",
    "4"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Provided that the State Government may exclude any districts or tracts of country from its operation.]",
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 90.024,
   "x1": 537.1219199999996,
   "top": 262.23464,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "(3) It shall come into force on the first day of January, 1909.",
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 90.024,
   "x1": 355.94984,
   "top": 278.91463999999996,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "STATE AMENDMENT",
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 249.29,
   "x1": 362.59351999999996,
   "top": 295.47464,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "STATE AMENDMENT",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "Karnataka",
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 72.024,
   "x1": 123.50351999999998,
   "top": 312.15464,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "Karnataka",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "Amendment of section 1.-For sub-section (3) of section 1 of the Registration (Karnataka",
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 108.02,
   "x1": 539.92216,
   "top": 328.8346399999999,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "Amendment of section 1",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "Amendment) Act, 1976 (Karnataka Act 55 of 1976) the following sub-section shall be and shall be",
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 90.024,
   "x1": 540.02608,
   "top": 341.43464,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "deemed have been substituted, namely:--",
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 90.024,
   "x1": 270.00633999999997,
   "top": 354.03463999999997,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "“(3) This section and sections 3, 13, 14, 16, 17 and 19 shall come into force at once and the other",
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 108.02,
   "x1": 539.82008,
   "top": 370.71464,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "sections shall come into force on such date as the State Government may, by notification, appoint and",
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 90.024,
   "x1": 539.7273599999995,
   "top": 383.31464,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "different sections areas.”",
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 90.024,
   "x1": 199.15439999999998,
   "top": 396.05464,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "[Vide Karnataka Act 64 of 1976, s. 2]",
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 72.024,
   "x1": 237.31376,
   "top": 412.73464,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "2. Definitions.—In this Act, unless there is anything repugnant in the subject or context,—",
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 90.024,
   "x1": 491.02000000000004,
   "top": 429.41463999999996,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "2. Definitions",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "(1) “Addition” means the place of residence, and the profession, trade, rank and title (if any) of a",
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 108.02,
   "x1": 539.6623999999997,
   "top": 446.09463999999997,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "person described, and in the case of [an Indian], *** his father's name, or where he is usually",
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 90.024,
   "x1": 539.9245599999999,
   "top": 458.69464,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": [
    "5",
    "6"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "described as the son of his mother, then his mother's name;",
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 90.024,
   "x1": 349.38672,
   "top": 471.29463999999996,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "(2) “Book” includes a portion of a book and also any number of sheets connected together with a",
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 108.02,
   "x1": 539.7929599999999,
   "top": 487.97463999999997,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "view of forming a book or portion of a book;",
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 90.024,
   "x1": 287.66208,
   "top": 500.57464,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "(3) “District” and “sub-district” respectively mean a district and sub-district formed under this",
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 108.02,
   "x1": 539.96104,
   "top": 517.25464,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "Act;",
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 90.024,
   "x1": 109.03488,
   "top": 529.85464,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "(4) “District Court” includes the High Court in its ordinary original civil jurisdiction;",
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 108.02,
   "x1": 482.00072,
   "top": 546.53464,
   "size": 11.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "1. It has been amended in its application to West Bengal by Ben. Act 5 of 1942 and West Ben. Acts 29 of 1950 and 31 of 1951;",
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 72.024,
   "x1": 539.4809999999995,
   "top": 584.13136,
   "size": 9.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "to Maharashtra by Bombay Acts 5 of 1929, 17 of 1930, 18 of 1933, 24 of 1939, 10 of 1939, 10 of 1942 and 6 of 1960,",
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 81.024,
   "x1": 539.5760000000001,
   "top": 595.444,
   "size": 9.0,
   "bold_prefix": "",
   "markers": []
  },
  {
   "text": "Maharashtra Acts 19 of 1960 and 20 of 1971; to the C.P. Act 1 of 1937 and M.P. Act 8 of 1965; to Madras and Andhra by",
   "page": 4,
   "x0": 81.024,
   "x1": 539.4929999999996,
